Yu-Gi-Oh!

18
00:02:40,460 --> 00:02:41,290
Yushu!

19
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,040
Don't think!

20
00:02:43,260 --> 00:02:44,436
Just start swinging!

21
00:02:46,300 --> 00:02:48,180
He makes it sound so easy.

22
