It's the light they're
afraid of the light.

23
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,717
I

24
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:08,800
am

25
00:03:10,180 --> 00:03:11,010
the great

26
00:03:11,093 --> 00:03:11,977
Ugachi the lizard

27
00:03:12,060 --> 00:03:14,520
killer you dare challenge me?

28
00:03:16,660 --> 00:03:20,940
I'm not just gonna challenge
you, I'll kill you!

29
00:03:55,600 --> 00:03:57,180
Sword skill.

30
00:03:58,360 --> 00:04:00,060
Sharp nail!

31
00:04:19,860 --> 00:04:20,920
Kirito!

32
00:04:22,420 --> 00:04:23,397
God!

33
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:27,720
VR never hurt like this!

34
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:30,680
You rotten little idiot, you brat!

35
00:04:30,940 --> 00:04:33,160
Take my arm, save me!

36
00:04:39,820 --> 00:04:43,120
You pay in blood!

37
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:51,400
I'll rip you in half.

38
00:04:51,820 --> 00:04:52,880
Eat your guts.

39
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:55,160
Cheats you less than insane.

40
00:05:15,620 --> 00:05:16,720
I'm scared.

41
00:05:19,220 --> 00:05:20,050
What?

42
00:05:20,220 --> 00:05:22,000
I can't just stand here.

43
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:25,584
I can't make the same
mistake I made with Alice.

44
00:05:42,100 --> 00:05:42,930
Die!

45
00:05:43,013 --> 00:05:43,843
I...

46
00:05:43,926 --> 00:05:45,040
DETAIL!

47
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:50,630
It's time!

48
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:54,630
I'll fight!

49
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:59,153
And protect my friends!

50
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:02,630
Run, Yu-Gi-Oh!

51
00:06:14,200 --> 00:06:29,320
Yu-Gi-Oh!

52
00:06:30,940 --> 00:06:32,940
Hang on, Yu-Gi-Oh! Please!

53
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:37,280
We made a promise.

54
00:06:37,640 --> 00:06:39,320
You, me, and Alice.

55
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:43,380
Yes, we promised we'd protect each other.

56
00:06:45,400 --> 00:06:49,040
I couldn't six years ago, but now,

57
00:06:49,380 --> 00:06:53,880
finally, I got to.

58
00:07:06,620 --> 00:07:07,637
That's right.

59
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:09,140
I couldn't either.

60
00:07:12,520 --> 00:07:14,880
Your turn now.

61
00:07:24,100 --> 00:07:26,340
Now you die!

62
00:07:26,900 --> 00:07:29,480
I'm presenting who you are!

63
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:37,240
My name's Kirito.

64
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,697
Kitty tell the swordsman!

65
00:07:39,780 --> 00:07:42,060
Either way, you die!

66
00:07:43,140 --> 00:07:45,840
Maybe he's a Flux Blight,
like everyone else.

67
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:49,230
Still!

68
00:07:50,900 --> 00:07:53,980
If I don't kill him, he'll kill us!

69
00:07:54,900 --> 00:07:56,080
Sword skill!

70
00:07:57,380 --> 00:07:59,260
Sonic! Leave!

71
00:08:14,900 --> 00:08:15,730
Fight's over.

72
00:08:15,820 --> 00:08:16,879
Your boss is dead.

73
00:08:17,280 --> 00:08:19,809
You want to die the
same way, then step up.

74
00:08:19,900 --> 00:08:23,880
But if you want to live, then
go back to the Dark Territory!

75
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:38,840
Hang in there.

76
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:46,310
Selka!

77
00:08:46,393 --> 00:08:47,223
Come on, wake up!

78
00:08:51,220 --> 00:08:53,102
Kirito, what are you doing here?

79
00:08:53,260 --> 00:08:54,917
We came to take you back home.

80
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:56,980
Can you walk okay? In a bit.

81
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,600
My legs are numb and...

82
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:02,140
Hey, put me down!

83
00:09:02,460 --> 00:09:03,519
Yuji-Oh needs you.

84
00:09:03,620 --> 00:09:05,240
He's hurt bad. He's dying!

85
00:09:10,300 --> 00:09:12,380
My secret art skills aren't enough.

86
00:09:13,040 --> 00:09:14,920
The wound is much too deep.

87
00:09:15,340 --> 00:09:16,900
But you can at least try.

88
00:09:17,340 --> 00:09:18,537
You're Alice's sister.

89
00:09:18,620 --> 00:09:19,561
You can do this.

90
00:09:20,820 --> 00:09:23,080
All I can heal are simple scratches.

91
00:09:23,580 --> 00:09:26,933
If Alice were here, she could
help him more than I could.

92
00:09:27,420 --> 00:09:31,361
Look, you Geo's hurt because he
came to save you, Selka, not Alice.

93
00:09:31,680 --> 00:09:33,151
He's here because of you.

94
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:39,769
The usual healing arts
would take too long.

95
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:43,059
I'll have to try a dangerous
high-level one instead.

96
00:09:43,620 --> 00:09:46,796
Kirito, I'm going to need
your help to make this work.

97
00:09:47,020 --> 00:09:49,280
Okay, you got it. What do I do?

98
00:09:49,700 --> 00:09:51,053
Give me your left hand.

99
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,767
I've never done this before.

100
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:59,717
And if I fail, there's a
chance both of us will die.

101
00:09:59,800 --> 00:10:01,506
I just want you to know that.

102
00:10:01,900 --> 00:10:04,488
If that happens, make
sure it only kills me.

103
00:10:05,140 --> 00:10:06,120
Let's do this.

104
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:07,670
Mm-hmm.

105
00:10:08,920 --> 00:10:09,800
System call.

106
00:10:10,920 --> 00:10:13,440
Transfer human unit durability.

107
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,900
Right hand to left.

108
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:26,440
She's transferring her
life and mine to him.

109
00:10:29,760 --> 00:10:33,080
Kirito, can you keep going?

110
00:10:33,460 --> 00:10:34,640
I'm okay.

111
00:10:36,220 --> 00:10:37,050
Hey, don't stop.

112
00:10:37,133 --> 00:10:38,200
Give him more.

113
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:49,440
Kirito, Eugeo, come and find me.

114
00:10:49,700 --> 00:10:50,640
I am waiting.

115
00:10:52,660 --> 00:10:55,200
At the top of the central cathedral.

116
00:10:58,760 --> 00:11:01,420
I will wait there for you both.

117
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:03,540
Who was that?

118
00:11:07,420 --> 00:11:08,250
Kirito!

119
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:16,150
Fifty!

120
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:22,737
How's your wound doing?

121
00:11:22,820 --> 00:11:24,440
Better? Much better.

122
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:28,020
All I needed was a day's
rest, and it's almost...

123
00:11:30,140 --> 00:11:33,097
I've been wanting to ask you
about something you said.

124
00:11:33,180 --> 00:11:35,886
Back in the cave, right
before you passed out?

125
00:11:36,920 --> 00:11:38,377
I don't know if you remember,

126
00:11:38,460 --> 00:11:42,537
but it sounded like you thought you,
Alice, and me were friends before.

127
00:11:42,620 --> 00:11:43,561
Yes, I remember.

128
00:11:43,700 --> 00:11:47,317
But we only just met, so I don't
know where all that came from.

129
00:11:47,400 --> 00:11:50,812
It's like, at that moment, I
could see it as clear as day.

130
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:52,640
You, Alice, and me.

131
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:56,675
We were born on the same day
and grew up together here.

132
00:11:57,280 --> 00:12:00,280
We were even together the
day Alice was taken away.

133
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:02,430
That's weird.

134
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:06,537
By the way, when Selka was healing
you, you didn't happen to hear,

135
00:12:06,620 --> 00:12:08,280
like, a voice, did you?

136
00:12:08,740 --> 00:12:12,360
No, I was totally unconscious,
so I didn't hear a thing. Why?

137
00:12:12,540 --> 00:12:13,775
Did you hear a voice?

138
00:12:14,580 --> 00:12:16,160
I guess I dreamed it.

139
00:12:16,620 --> 00:12:17,520
Forget I asked.

140
00:12:18,040 --> 00:12:18,870
Oh, well.

141
00:12:18,953 --> 00:12:20,116
Time to get to work.

142
00:12:21,360 --> 00:12:22,540
Right. Here you go.

143
00:12:24,980 --> 00:12:26,360
I'm gonna use this.

144
00:12:32,700 --> 00:12:36,400
Wait, you can, you can wield the sword?

145
00:12:38,040 --> 00:12:39,746
You might want to stand back.

146
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:49,780
Because of that fight
with the goblins, now,

147
00:12:50,040 --> 00:12:53,216
my object control authority
is higher than the swords.

148
00:12:54,880 --> 00:12:55,820
Here goes.

149
00:12:56,920 --> 00:12:57,750
AHHHHHHHHH!

150
00:13:08,140 --> 00:13:08,970
Nice!

151
00:13:13,580 --> 00:13:15,920
I bet you can swing it just as easy.

152
00:13:29,820 --> 00:13:31,780
Kirito, will you...

153
00:13:35,660 --> 00:13:37,760
Will you teach me to use a sword?

154
00:13:39,060 --> 00:13:41,620
If so, I can go get Alice back.

155
00:13:42,940 --> 00:13:43,770
Yujiro.

156
00:13:44,300 --> 00:13:46,960
Alice and her family
have suffered so much.

157
00:13:47,380 --> 00:13:48,880
All because of me.

158
00:13:59,520 --> 00:14:01,140
I couldn't save her.

159
00:14:01,740 --> 00:14:03,980
I don't know why, but I couldn't.

160
00:14:04,160 --> 00:14:07,572
And for the past six years, I
never stopped regretting it.

161
00:14:11,560 --> 00:14:13,680
I want to become strong.

162
00:14:14,100 --> 00:14:16,360
So I can fight.

163
00:14:16,820 --> 00:14:19,349
So I can keep from
making the same mistake.

164
00:14:22,060 --> 00:14:24,940
So I can get back what I lost years ago.

165
00:14:25,900 --> 00:14:26,760
That's why.

166
00:14:27,740 --> 00:14:30,093
That's why I want to become a swordsman.

167
00:14:31,780 --> 00:14:33,780
All right, then. You're on.

168
00:14:34,360 --> 00:14:36,301
I'll teach you everything I know.

169
00:14:39,140 --> 00:14:41,552
The training's going to be tough, though.

170
00:14:43,780 --> 00:14:45,133
That's what I'm hoping.

171
00:14:49,540 --> 00:14:53,364
Before we start, do you remember
what your sword style is called?

172
00:14:58,000 --> 00:14:59,580
Yeah, I remember.

173
00:15:01,540 --> 00:15:03,560
It's the Aincrad style.

174
00:15:25,040 --> 00:15:27,200
All right, Eugeo. Finish it.

175
00:15:53,680 --> 00:15:54,620
Hey, look it!

176
00:16:12,300 --> 00:16:14,100
This is like a dream.

177
00:16:14,420 --> 00:16:16,538
I never thought this day would come.

178
00:16:17,800 --> 00:16:22,480
I didn't believe in
destiny before, but now...

179
00:16:24,620 --> 00:16:27,097
Kirito, my calling wasn't my destiny.

180
00:16:27,180 --> 00:16:31,420
For the past six years, I've
been waiting for you to come!

181
00:16:34,020 --> 00:16:35,580
Yeah, maybe you were.

182
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:42,000
But then again, maybe I woke up
here just so I could meet you?

183
00:16:56,940 --> 00:16:58,320
Why are you here alone?

184
00:17:00,500 --> 00:17:03,853
Oh, Eugio's with your dad
somewhere, talking about stuff.

185
00:17:04,240 --> 00:17:05,420
Oh, I see.

186
00:17:05,780 --> 00:17:08,077
I'm sure he's getting
a lot of well-deserved

187
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:10,513
praise for chopping down the demon tree.

188
00:17:11,860 --> 00:17:14,437
After all the effort he
put in, he deserves it.

189
00:17:14,520 --> 00:17:19,344
I decided to study harder so I can be as
good at the sacred arts as my sister was.

190
00:17:20,660 --> 00:17:22,840
Not so I can be like her, mind you.

191
00:17:25,460 --> 00:17:28,097
I wasn't trying to copy
her by going to the cave.

192
00:17:28,180 --> 00:17:30,800
I would never cross
into the dark territory.

193
00:17:31,260 --> 00:17:36,180
But I thought by taking the same path
she did, I'd get closer to her, somehow.

194
00:17:38,480 --> 00:17:41,020
I wanted to go in as far as I could.

195
00:17:42,020 --> 00:17:42,850
In a way,

196
00:17:43,060 --> 00:17:45,497
I guess the whole point
of going there was to

197
00:17:45,580 --> 00:17:48,227
prove to myself I could
never take her place.

198
00:17:48,720 --> 00:17:51,040
No, but you're still amazing.

199
00:17:51,840 --> 00:17:52,670
Me?

200
00:17:52,753 --> 00:17:56,681
What other girl here could walk
into that dark cave all by herself?

201
00:17:56,980 --> 00:17:59,680
I mean, that's something
only you could do.

202
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:01,580
Only I could do?

203
00:18:02,040 --> 00:18:03,511
What do you mean by that?

204
00:18:04,120 --> 00:18:06,400
You're you, not Alice's replacement.

205
00:18:06,800 --> 00:18:09,260
And you got skills no one else here has.

206
00:18:09,820 --> 00:18:12,349
With a little practice,
you'll master them.

207
00:18:14,980 --> 00:18:17,060
May I have your attention, please?

208
00:18:17,880 --> 00:18:22,120
The greatest wish of Rulet's
founders has been fulfilled.

209
00:18:22,620 --> 00:18:24,960
The demon tree has been felled at last.

210
00:18:26,740 --> 00:18:31,340
So let us all give thanks
to Eugeo, son of Oryx.

211
00:18:33,120 --> 00:18:34,420
According to the law,

212
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:36,762
when one finishes their calling,

213
00:18:37,020 --> 00:18:40,577
they have earned the right to choose
what their next calling will be.

214
00:18:40,660 --> 00:18:42,060
Go ahead, Eugeo.

215
00:18:42,420 --> 00:18:43,700
Make your choice.

216
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:08,717
I shall

217
00:19:08,800 --> 00:19:14,477
train

218
00:19:14,560 --> 00:19:15,937
hard and

219
00:19:16,020 --> 00:19:17,440
journey to Senator.

220
00:19:19,140 --> 00:19:22,760
Uh, Eugeo, what could you possibly...

221
00:19:26,600 --> 00:19:29,140
No, I won't question you.

222
00:19:29,700 --> 00:19:33,120
It is your church-given right
to choose your next calling.

223
00:19:34,680 --> 00:19:40,220
As Rulet's elder, I approve
Eugeo's new calling as swordsman!

224
00:19:52,580 --> 00:19:53,410
Selka.

225
00:19:55,980 --> 00:19:56,810
Eugeo.

226
00:19:57,320 --> 00:20:00,520
Before I go, I wanted
to tell you something.

227
00:20:01,100 --> 00:20:01,930
Oh?

228
00:20:02,013 --> 00:20:02,843
What is it?

229
00:20:03,420 --> 00:20:08,260
My goal is to go to Senator
and bring Alice back here.

230
00:20:08,600 --> 00:20:09,880
I thought so.

231
00:20:10,660 --> 00:20:14,037
For the past six years, it's
all I've been thinking about.

232
00:20:14,120 --> 00:20:19,000
But with my calling, I had
no idea how I'd go about it.

233
00:20:20,600 --> 00:20:22,720
Then Kirito suddenly showed up,

234
00:20:22,820 --> 00:20:25,817
and bringing Alice back
didn't seem hopeless anymore.

235
00:20:25,900 --> 00:20:29,606
For some reason, I feel like I
can do anything with him around.

236
00:20:30,120 --> 00:20:34,260
You and your family have suffered
so much, all on account of me.

237
00:20:35,320 --> 00:20:38,360
So, I'll bring Alice back
and make things right.

238
00:20:40,180 --> 00:20:43,080
Have faith in me, and wait for our return.

239
00:20:44,480 --> 00:20:48,600
Well, I can't stop you,
but if you insist… I do.

240
00:20:51,700 --> 00:20:53,460
Okay, I shall wait.

241
00:20:55,940 --> 00:20:58,411
Just make sure the three of you come back.

242
00:21:01,680 --> 00:21:03,856
I'll make sure we all come back safe.

243
00:21:04,100 --> 00:21:04,930
Promise.

244
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:06,090
Good luck!

245
00:21:14,120 --> 00:21:15,649
Sorry to keep you waiting.

246
00:21:15,860 --> 00:21:16,720
No worries.

247
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:21,060
Well then, are you ready?

248
00:21:21,580 --> 00:21:22,410
Uh-huh.

249
00:21:23,960 --> 00:21:26,180
I wonder what Central will be like.

250
00:21:26,580 --> 00:21:27,420
Who knows?

251
00:21:34,360 --> 00:21:37,200
It's gotta be way bigger
than Rulid, right?

252
00:21:38,660 --> 00:21:40,320
I certainly hope so.

253
00:21:45,580 --> 00:21:47,260
It looks like rain's coming.

254
00:21:47,860 --> 00:21:50,389
We should hurry before
we get caught in it.

255
00:21:53,240 --> 00:21:54,070
What's wrong?

256
00:21:54,640 --> 00:21:55,470
Huh? What?

257
00:21:55,840 --> 00:21:57,560
Never mind. Shall we go?

258
00:21:59,000 --> 00:21:59,830
Yeah.

259
00:22:23,580 --> 00:22:26,740
Let's do it.

260
00:22:44,120 --> 00:22:48,120
I'm not sure if you want
to keep me in the same way.

261
00:22:50,800 --> 00:22:54,780
I'm not sure if I want you.

262
00:22:56,480 --> 00:22:57,937
I'm not sure if I want you.

263
00:22:58,020 --> 00:22:59,961
I'm still not sure if I want you.

264
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:05,057
I'm not sure

265
00:23:05,140 --> 00:23:11,360
if I want you.

266
00:23:36,080 --> 00:23:38,260
Next time, Ocean Turtle.

267
00:23:41,360 --> 00:23:41,965
You
